WEBVTT

00:00:00.761 --> 00:00:03.460
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I went onto the Twin Strangers website.

00:00:04.269 --> 00:00:07.395
All you have to do is pay $3.95,

00:00:07.768 --> 00:00:14.108
upload a photo of your face, and then describe it, your nose, mouth, and eyes.

00:00:15.431 --> 00:00:19.295
I looked in a mirror and decided that I have an oval face,

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:23.315
blue eyes, and, unfortunately, thin lips.

00:00:24.497 --> 00:00:28.236
Immediately I got a lot of photos of possible matches.

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:33.727
My first reaction was ‘They all look totally different from me’.

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:37.397
Then something interesting began to happen.

00:00:38.468 --> 00:00:43.031
Some of the people started to look familiar, like people in my family.

00:00:44.102 --> 00:00:47.056
I found one woman who looked just like my brother.

00:00:47.911 --> 00:00:51.619
 I started to wonder. Was there something there?

00:00:52.785 --> 00:00:56.629
I called my husband to come and have a look at all these ‘twins’.

00:00:57.375 --> 00:01:02.985
His first reaction was the same as mine, but then he went a bit quiet.

00:01:03.858 --> 00:01:09.154
He pointed to one woman who, at first sight, looks completely different from me,

00:01:09.342 --> 00:01:12.908
but whose picture I had stopped at several times.

00:01:13.661 --> 00:01:21.212
He said ‘She has the same mouth as you. In fact, she’s a bit like you.’ And he was right.

00:01:22.529 --> 00:01:29.116
I decided to change my profile a bit. Many people tell me I look younger than I really am,

00:01:29.599 --> 00:01:37.585
so I put my age as ten years younger, and then searched again. The result was surprising.

00:01:38.791 --> 00:01:44.203
Suddenly there seemed to be a number of women a bit like me. Especially one.

00:01:45.068 --> 00:01:49.773
I put her picture on my Facebook page and asked my friends what they thought.

00:01:50.726 --> 00:01:58.021
The first person to answer was my brother. ‘Yes,’ he wrote. ‘She looks like you and our sister.’

00:01:59.608 --> 00:02:03.744
It’s a strange feeling. I keep looking at her picture.

00:02:04.656 --> 00:02:11.616
We’re very similar, but not identical, for example, she has brown eyes, but mine are blue.

00:02:12.497 --> 00:02:17.078
But there's something there. Not just the blonde hair and the thin lips.

00:02:17.244 --> 00:02:20.451
There's something in her eyes that I recognize.

00:02:21.578 --> 00:02:26.474
It’s a very strange feeling, but I’m really happy that I found her.

00:02:27.093 --> 00:02:31.592
I sent her a message through the website, but she hasn’t replied yet.

00:02:32.576 --> 00:02:36.476
I’m going to keep trying. I want to know who she is.